        a pink sweet liquid.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[2].message
      value: Then, I poured the liquid into a form.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[3].message
      value: Next, I put the long thingy thing into the liquid. But not entirely.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[4].message
      value: Afterwards, I put the shape into the great warm box.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 879850669860624744, guid: 8c674a4c14a69ed4db34a6efff8964aa, type: 3}
      propertyPath: statements.Array.data[5].message
      value: Finally, I placed the shape into the great world outside.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
